# ==============================================================================
# Inkling-2-Small TP8 (8x NVIDIA DGX Spark, GB10 SM121a) — V16-FINAL CHAMPION
# Empirically qualified & pruned on live 8-node GB10 silicon (2026-11-25)
# 100% 0-ULP Bit-Exact Gate: exact_ink 10/10 SHA-256 1dcfb30680d0252c9c259e5cb2bd02d402b2f6123261f904a0074d3b5b46f8c3
#
# Live-Verified Upgrades Over V12-FINAL:
#   1. RDMA V16 (rdma_ar_ext_c32_v16.so): register-fused BF12 C=4..32 + 25s timeout resilience
#   2. C48 MoE V16 (libnvfp4_ws5_c48_v16.so + libmxfp8_mx7_c48_v16.so, BN16=8/W2=6, EVICT=1, LPT=0, FC_MODE=-1)
#   3. CertHead V14 M<=128 (libcert_head_fast_v14.so, 127/127 exact b1_exact -> eliminates C=32 FP32 fallback!)
#   4. Attn V16 Long-Ctx S=48 (libfused_decode_attn_exact_sm121_v16.so, V12 SWA/short preserved!) -> +15..18 tok/s @ 1M decode
#   5. Zero-Sync temp>0 Sampling (libsync_free_temp_v16.so, DTGraph V14/V16, SyncFree Fast V14, CertHead Temp Direct V16)
#   6. Non-Tail Draft Prefill Skip V16 + Markov Auto-Slices
#   7. V15/V16 Prefill Mixed-Decode Guards, Strict Shadow-K Verify & Zero-Overhead Background Telemetry (/dev/shm)
#
# Pruned (Empirically Rejected on Live Silicon):
#   TREE_SPEC, MOE_S8 (v10/v5/c1_v16), BF11_V13, ROUTER_V14, L2PF_V16, DRAFT_SWA_SPARSE,
#   SPEC_K=15 / DYN_K_EXTEND_V16, HETERO_BUDGET_SPEC, Prefill_V16 (W13_V6/W2_V5/MX7_V10/FP8_ATTN_V13),
#   KV_BF12_GLOBAL_ONLY, LPT=2 (PDL WorkQueue race), DECODE_EDGE_GUARD_V15 (hot-path graph alloc)
# ==============================================================================
